[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――夢を追うすべての者よ！\nどうかこのロマンにその一票を預けてほしい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—To all those who chase their dreams! I ask you to entrust your vote to me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "以上だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいぞー！\u3000ロマン！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Way to go, Roman!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "男子生徒Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Male Student A"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "感動した！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That was moving!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "男子生徒Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Male Student B"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……さすがだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...That's him alright."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "す、すごい拍手……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-wow, what applause..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "呑まれるな。練習通りやればいい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Don't get overwhelmed. Just do as we practiced."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わ、分かってるけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I know, but..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もし負けたとしても、それは私が至らなかっただけの\nことだ。ロロナが気負う必要はない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even if we lose, it will only be because I wasn't good enough. You don't need to pressure yourself, Rorona."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……前よりもいい顔になったね。\n思い悩む者の顔だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Your look better than before. That's the face of someone with deep thoughts."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、君には任せられない。\n悪いけど、僕は僕を信じている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That said, I can't leave this to you. Sorry, but I believe in myself and my platform."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロマン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Roman"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では、続いての候補者は２年生のユナさんです。\n推薦人の方は壇上にお上がりください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Next up is second-year student, Juna. Would her endorser please come to the stage?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選挙委員",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Election Committee Member"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は、はいっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユ、ユナさんの推薦人を務めます……\n錬金術科２年、ロロライナ・フリクセルでしゅ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm here to endorse Juna... I'm Rorolina Frixell, second-year alchemy student!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（か、噛んじゃったぁ……！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Oh no, I stuttered...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "先輩、緊張してますね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The senior is really nervous..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さっきの演説の後だもん。しょうがないよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "After Roman's speech, it's understandable."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、いい具合に空気がほぐれたんじゃない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I think it helped lighten the mood a bit, don't you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ロロナ先輩、頑張って……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You can do it, Miss Rorona...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（うう……もう開き直るしか！）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Ugh... I'll just have to power through!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今回、同級生であり、同じ部活の仲間でもある\nユナさんの応援演説を担当させていただきます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Today I'm honored to endorse Juna, my classmate and club member."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ユナさんは勉学も、部活も、普段の振る舞いも、\n他の生徒のお手本になるような人で――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna is exemplary in her studies, club activities, and daily conduct, truly a role model for other students—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――ユナさんは、色々な学校へ留学した経験を活かし、\n皆さんに幅広い体験の場を与えてくれるはずです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "—Juna will use her experience studying abroad at various schools to provide everyone with opportunities for broader experiences."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぜひ、清き一票をよろしくお願いします！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please consider giving her your vote!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……い、以上です！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Th-that's all!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほっ……なんとか最後までしゃべれた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew... I managed to get through it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、ロロナらしくていい演説だった！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, that was a great speech, it came from the heart!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あとはユナ先輩を残すのみ……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now it's all up to Miss Juna...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "先ほどの盛り上がりを見るに、やや分は悪いかも\nしれませんが……あとは信じるだけです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Judging by the response, the odds might be stacked against us... but all we can do now is believe in her."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "続いて、候補者の所信表明演説です。\nユナさん、壇上にお上がりください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Next is the candidate's platform speech. Juna, please come forward."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選挙委員",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Election Committee Member"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Juna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では、始めてください",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Please begin."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "選挙委員",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Election Committee Member"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]